    <string name="third_party">Third party components</string>
    <string name="third_party_body">FFmpeg (GPL) via FFmpegKit full-gpl · x264 · x265 · libvpx · libaom · dav1d · Opus · LAME · Vorbis · libass · Jetpack Compose and Material 3 (Apache-2.0). All of them keep their own licenses and copyrights.</string>
